{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:abbr","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ק׳"}
{"end":"t:abbr"}
{"start":"t:expan","attrs":{}}
{"text":"קהל"}
{"end":"t:expan"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":" תְּהִלּוֹת כְּבוֹדְךָ, אָמְצְךָ מְלֹא כָל הָאָרֶץ. שִׁמְעֲךָ דִּין מִשָּׁמַיִם, בְּכֵן יָרְאָה וְשָׁקְטָה הָאָרֶץ. רַעַשׁ יוֹם מִשְׁפָּט, "}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}id":"musaf_tehillot_kevodekha_source_variant_1"}}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:condition:poem:tehillot_kevodekha/tehillot/gaashu"}}
{"text":"גָּעֲשׁוּ"}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:condition:poem:tehillot_kevodekha/tehillot/geash"}}
{"text":"גֵּעַשׁ"}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"tail":" תְּהוֹמוֹת הָאָרֶץ. קוֹל שׁוֹפָר חָזָק, דִּבֵּר וַיִּקְרָא אָרֶץ. צְבִי לַצַּדִּיק בְּזֶמֶר, הִשְׁמִיעָה כְּנַף הָאָרֶץ. פַּחַד וָפַחַת וָפַח, וּפַלָּצוּת יַבְעִיתוּ אָרֶץ. עֵת תָּקוּם לַמִּשְׁפָּט, זְעוֹם כָּל אַפְסֵי אָרֶץ.  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:tehillot_kevodekha/sollu_pannu"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"description","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:instruction:role/reader","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:abbr","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ח׳"}
{"end":"t:abbr"}
{"start":"t:expan","attrs":{}}
{"text":"חזן"}
{"end":"t:expan"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}id":"musaf_tehillot_kevodekha_source_variant_2"}}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:condition:poem:tehillot_kevodekha/sollu_pannu/sollu_pannu"}}
{"text":"סֹלּוּ פַּנּוּ"}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:condition:poem:tehillot_kevodekha/sollu_pannu/suru_minni"}}
{"text":"סוּרוּ מִנִּי"}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"tail":" דֶּרֶךְ יְנוֹבְבוּ, חֲרֵדִים מֵחֶרְדַּת הָאָרֶץ. נָאוֹר וְאַדִּיר, טַעַם תָּשִׁיב לָאָרֶץ. מַה תִּירְאִי אֲדָמָה, יָרִיעוּ תַּחְתִּיֹּת אָרֶץ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
