{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"description","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:instruction:role/reader_and_congregation","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:abbr","attrs":{}}
{"text":"קו״ח"}
{"end":"t:abbr"}
{"start":"t:expan","attrs":{}}
{"text":"קהל וחזן"}
{"end":"t:expan"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":" לְהִתְוַדַּע וּלְהִגָּלוֹת, כִּי הוּא מֶלֶךְ עַל כָּל הָאָרֶץ. כְּמוֹ פֵּאֲרוּהוּ מֵאָז בַּשַּׁחַק, יֻרְשׁוּ בְּחוּנָיו לְפָאֲרוֹ בָּאָרֶץ: "}
